From: Julian Decker <git@deckerjulian.com>
Subject: regulator: rk808: list the rk808-regulator cell

The RK808 MFD adds a cell named "rk808-regulator", and the probe handles
RK808_ID. The driver has an id table though, and with one the platform bus
no longer falls back to the driver name, so the table has to list the cell
or it never binds. It listed all variants but this one.

---
--- a/drivers/regulator/rk808-regulator.c
+++ b/drivers/regulator/rk808-regulator.c
@@ -1776,6 +1776,7 @@
 
 static const struct platform_device_id rk8xx_regulator_id_table[] = {
 	{ "rk805-regulator", 0 },
+	{ "rk808-regulator", 0 },
 	{ "rk809-regulator", 0 },
 	{ "rk816-regulator", 0 },
 	{ "rk817-regulator", 0 },
